{"3361810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JR's Christmas Adventure", "steam_appid": 3361810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><strong>&quot;JR’s Christmas Adventure: A Holiday Conspiracy Unfolds!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Jessica on her unpredictable journey as she volunteers at her favorite holiday charity, only to be entangled in a web of intrigue and deception. Your choices will shape the outcome of her story, leading you down paths filled with laughter, drama, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Jessica make it home safely? Will she trust the wrong people or uncover hidden truths? Will she finally get that warm drink she's been craving?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate this interactive fiction adventure, you will discover secrets, meet quirky characters, and unravel a conspiracy that will keep you guessing until the end. But be warned: not everyone is as they seem, including Saint Nick himself...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique endings to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to choose from, shaping Jessica's story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky characters and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the holiday hijinks in &quot;JR’s Christmas Adventure&quot; for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thank you for visiting my page!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This product is unpolished and has rough edges, but if you can look past that, there is fun to be found. It was completed in five rushed weeks by a single passionate gamer who pretends to be a dev. They were learning new AI tools and made a lot of mistakes. They promise to learn from their mistakes, and they appreciate your forgiveness for any foolishness that transpires.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><strong>&quot;JR’s Christmas Adventure: A Holiday Conspiracy Unfolds!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Jessica on her unpredictable journey as she volunteers at her favorite holiday charity, only to be entangled in a web of intrigue and deception. Your choices will shape the outcome of her story, leading you down paths filled with laughter, drama, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Jessica make it home safely? Will she trust the wrong people or uncover hidden truths? Will she finally get that warm drink she's been craving?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate this interactive fiction adventure, you will discover secrets, meet quirky characters, and unravel a conspiracy that will keep you guessing until the end. But be warned: not everyone is as they seem, including Saint Nick himself...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique endings to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to choose from, shaping Jessica's story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky characters and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the holiday hijinks in &quot;JR’s Christmas Adventure&quot; for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thank you for visiting my page!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This product is unpolished and has rough edges, but if you can look past that, there is fun to be found. It was completed in five rushed weeks by a single passionate gamer who pretends to be a dev. They were learning new AI tools and made a lot of mistakes. They promise to learn from their mistakes, and they appreciate your forgiveness for any foolishness that transpires.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_descri